title: Detection of Potential LSASS Memory Dumping via Process Access
id: 5f3a18a9-4d21-4b15-9c88-123456789abc
status: experimental
description: Detects process access requests targeting lsass.exe with high-privilege access masks typical of credential theft tools (e.g., Mimikatz, ProcDump).
author: Lee Blackbeard
date: 2026-11-09
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/001/
logsource:
  category: process_access
  product: windows
detection:
  selection:
    TargetImage|endswith: '\lsass.exe'
    GrantedAccess:
      - '0x1010'
      - '0x1F0FFF'
  filter_legit:
    SourceImage|endswith:
      - '\system32\svchost.exe'
      - '\system32\csrss.exe'
  condition: selection and not filter_legit
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate security agents or system diagnostics tools.
level: high
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1003.001
